### Create collection
POST http://localhost:8080/collection/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "babies",
  "fields": [
    {
      "name": "name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "age",
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
  "parentCollection": "pandas"
}

### Insert document into collection
POST http://localhost:8080/document/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collection": "babies",
  "fields": {
    "name": "lena",
    "age": 5
  },
  "parentDocUuid": "f48d6c17-a399-4ac4-9eca-dfded6b1bb2d"
}